              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipka pïchï le 642 cho pö ara Delaya nko Topiya nko Nekoda. Kipkana chane kanastina Tel Mela nko Tel Arsya nko Kerup nko Adon nko Imer, wölo melö mi kïgh nyo kiporu lö pipö Israel chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.61+NEH.7.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.61",
