        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pröyönto pöytoghin ompö pipö Yaudi chane, “Melö omekwa omisyewut cho kïropchini Tororöt ntökïtenö kïrumï tïsin nyo pöghisyegho Urim nko Tumim.”*",
